# Font

Always system sans. No serif. No Inter/Roboto as brand pick — use OS stack:

```
ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif
```

Body / header / lists / captions = same font.

Bad: Source Serif, Georgia, Times, special display font for UI copy.
Good: stack above via `font-sans` or body default.
